  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \n  \nCause of Bug  \n------------  \nBug is present in below mentioned code in PDFiumEngine::GetVisiblePageIndex(FPDF_PAGE page) method in pdfium_engine.cc file.  \n  \n for (int page_index : visible_pages_) {  \n   if (pages_[page_index]->GetPage() == page)  \n     return page_"
